---
// /about/ — Rewritten 2026-07-27. SOLO-OPERATOR narrative.
// The previous version claimed a "core team" and an on-call bench of BCG/McKinsey/Bain/Big-Four
// consultants. That was not true — Agni is one operator — and it was falsifiable in five minutes
// against shopagni.com/team/. Removed entirely. Do not reintroduce plural-staff or named-firm
// claims here unless those people actually exist and have agreed to be represented.
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="About &mdash; One operator, not an agency | Agni AI Store"
  description="Agni AI Store is the customer-lifecycle service of Agni Consulting. One senior marketing-operations operator who has wired this exact stack inside venture-backed B2B SaaS, now building it for owner-operated service businesses across Canada and the US."
>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="ai-hero">
    <p class="ai-eyebrow">ABOUT</p>
    <h1>One operator. <br>Not an agency. <br>Built for service businesses.</h1>
    <p class="ai-lead">
      Agni AI Store is the customer-lifecycle service of <a href="https://shopagni.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color:var(--accent);">Agni Consulting</a> &mdash; a North American marketing-operations practice. I&rsquo;ve spent seven years wiring this exact stack inside venture-backed B2B SaaS, and brought it down to where it&rsquo;s genuinely needed: owner-operated service businesses across Canada and the United States.
    </p>
  </section>

  <!-- The team -->
  <section class="ai-section">
    <div class="ai-wrap ai-narrow">
      <p class="ai-eyebrow">Who you get</p>
      <h2>The person who scopes it is the person who builds it.</h2>
      <p style="color:var(--tx-soft);line-height:1.75;margin-top:18px;">
        My background is marketing operations and demand generation inside Series-A and Series-B B2B SaaS companies. I&rsquo;ve wired HubSpot, Marketo, Salesforce, Outreach, Clay, GA4, Looker and Mixpanel end to end &mdash; the unsexy plumbing that decides whether a company hits its number or doesn&rsquo;t. Agni AI Store takes that same operating discipline and points it at the businesses that need it most: independent vet clinics, chiro practices, dental offices, med-spas and HVAC operators &mdash; the ones who don&rsquo;t have a CMO and don&rsquo;t want one.
      </p>
      <p style="color:var(--tx-soft);line-height:1.75;margin-top:14px;">
        Agni is deliberately one operator, and that is the point. You are not buying an agency&rsquo;s capacity, a pod, or a 50-person org chart you&rsquo;ll never use. When an engagement genuinely needs a specialist &mdash; a developer for a stubborn PIMS integration, a designer, a paid-media buyer &mdash; I source and manage that contractor directly and quote it separately, so you always know exactly who is doing what and what it costs.
      </p>
      <p style="color:var(--tx-soft);line-height:1.75;margin-top:14px;">
        The trade-off is honest: I take on a small number of engagements at a time. If I don&rsquo;t have the capacity to do your build properly, I&rsquo;ll tell you on the audit call rather than sell you a slot and staff it with someone you&rsquo;ve never met. No SDR, no junior, no handoff to an account manager who didn&rsquo;t hear the problem.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Bench at a glance -->
  <section class="ai-section">
    <div class="ai-wrap">
      <p class="ai-eyebrow" style="text-align:center;">What I actually do</p>
      <h2 style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:32px;">Four things, done properly, by one person.</h2>
      <div class="ai-grid-3">
        <div class="ai-card">
          <h3>Marketing operations</h3>
          <p style="color:var(--tx-soft);">Seven years inside Series-A and Series-B B2B SaaS &mdash; demand gen, RevOps, marketing-ops infrastructure, attribution and lifecycle automation. HubSpot, Marketo, Salesforce and Outreach wired end to end, not supervised from a slide.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ai-card">
          <h3>AI &amp; automation engineering</h3>
          <p style="color:var(--tx-soft);">Twilio, n8n, HighLevel, OpenAI, Anthropic and Synthflow / Vapi / Retell. Voice-AI training, integrations with legacy PIMS / FSM / EMR systems, and workflow orchestration that doesn&rsquo;t break the first time an input changes.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ai-card">
          <h3>Measurement you can check</h3>
          <p style="color:var(--tx-soft);">Every number is measured against a pre-engagement baseline captured during audit week. Pre-existing pipeline doesn&rsquo;t count as recovered. Seasonal growth doesn&rsquo;t count as lift. If a metric depends on a definition, the report says which one.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ai-card">
          <h3>Specialists, when the scope needs one</h3>
          <p style="color:var(--tx-soft);">A developer for a stubborn integration, a designer, a paid-media buyer. I source and manage the contractor directly and quote it separately &mdash; so it&rsquo;s a line item you approve, not a mystery resource on a retainer.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ai-card" style="border-color:var(--accent);background:var(--accent-soft);">
          <h3 style="color:var(--accent);">One operator runs your engagement.</h3>
          <p>The same person from the audit call through the monthly check-in &mdash; not a rotating cast of account managers. You always know who answers your email, because there is only one person it could be.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- The relationship -->
  <section class="ai-section">
    <div class="ai-wrap ai-narrow">
      <p class="ai-eyebrow">Parent brand</p>
      <h2>How Agni AI Store relates to Agni Consulting.</h2>
      <p style="color:var(--tx-soft);line-height:1.75;margin-top:16px;">
        <a href="https://shopagni.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color:var(--accent);">Agni Consulting</a> is the parent practice. It serves B2B SaaS companies $5M&ndash;$50M ARR with on-demand marketing leadership &mdash; fractional CMO, demand-gen overhauls, marketing-ops audits, RevOps integration. Different audience, same operating standard, same operator.
      </p>
      <p style="color:var(--tx-soft);line-height:1.75;margin-top:14px;">
        Agni AI Store is the productized service-business arm. We take the same operational backbone &mdash; lifecycle ops, automation, AI agents, integration plumbing &mdash; and apply it to vet clinics, chiropractors, dental practices, med-spas, HVAC operators, and the dozens of other owner-operated service businesses that have the same operational gaps as a Series-A SaaS company.
      </p>
      <p style="color:var(--tx-soft);line-height:1.75;margin-top:14px;">
        Two domains, two distinct ICPs, one operator, one quality bar. If you&rsquo;re looking for fractional CMO or B2B SaaS marketing-ops work, that&rsquo;s on the <a href="https://shopagni.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color:var(--accent);">Agni Consulting</a> site. If you&rsquo;re an owner-operator running a service business, you&rsquo;re in the right place here.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Geography -->
  <section class="ai-section-tight">
    <div class="ai-wrap ai-narrow">
      <p class="ai-eyebrow">Where we work</p>
      <h2>North America today. Globally over time.</h2>
      <p style="color:var(--tx-soft);line-height:1.75;margin-top:16px;">
        I&rsquo;m based in Toronto. I serve clients across Canada and the United States, with engagements in Europe by referral. Invoicing is in USD by default; Canadian clients can opt into CAD. Twilio numbers are local to your area code regardless of where I sit. Data residency, HIPAA BAAs, and PIPEDA-aware practices are configured per-engagement &mdash; details on the <a href="/trust/" style="color:var(--accent);">trust page</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="ai-section">
    <div class="ai-wrap ai-narrow" style="text-align:center;">
      <h2>Talk to a senior operator.</h2>
      <p class="ai-lead">No SDR. No junior. No discovery deck. The 30-minute audit is with a senior operator who could run your account if it lands.</p>
      <div class="ai-cta-row">
        <a class="ai-btn" href="https://calendly.com/aman-shopagni" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Book the audit &rarr;</a>
        <a class="ai-btn-ghost" href="https://shopagni.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Visit Agni Consulting</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
